(4123, 'db_upgraded', '', 'on'),
(7409, 'options_all_feedbacks_4_feedback_texts', 'As rightly named, Ramdhanu or Rainbow is a symbol of hope to many street children, who literally have very little hope in their lives. In today\'s selfish and pessimistic world, it shined as a beacon of compassion, to me.This was the first time I visited them and it was such an inspiring moment for me, my heart filled with happiness. I am so proud of you and your team\'s work.I have no doubt that Ramdhanu is providing an upliftment to their lives and am truly optimistic that Ramdhanu will bring a better tomorrow for a lot of kids. Let me wish you and your team all the best for all your future works.', 'no'),
