(2161, 189, 'mission_contents_our_vision', 'Our vision is a world where every child has equal opportunities to thrive and succeed, regardless of their circumstances. We envision a future where poverty and inequality no longer limit a child\'s potential and access to education, nutrition, and healthcare are universal rights. We believe that every child has the potential to make a positive impact on the world, and by empowering them with the tools they need to succeed, we can create a brighter future for all. We are committed to working towards this vision, one child at a time, and we invite others to join us on this journey.'),
