(6735, 435, 'section_4_contents_0_section4_title', '<h3>Nandini: Our Ray of Hope</h3>\r\n<div class=\"flex-1 overflow-hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-zhyut-79elbk h-full dark:bg-gray-800\">\r\n<div class=\"react-scroll-to-bottom--css-zhyut-1n7m0yu\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-sm dark:bg-gray-800\">\r\n<div class=\"group w-full text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-100 border-b border-black/10 dark:border-gray-900/50 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-[#444654]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex p-4 gap-4 text-base md:gap-6 md:max-w-2xl lg:max-w-xl xl:max-w-3xl md:py-6 lg:px-0 m-auto\">\r\n<div class=\"relative flex w-[calc(100%-50px)] flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3 lg:w-[calc(100%-115px)]\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col gap-3\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-[20px] flex flex-col items-start gap-4 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light\">\r\n\r\nMeet Nandini, a 2-year-old blind girl from a remote village in Jharkhand. When our team met her at a blind home during a food distribution drive, we knew we had to help her. Our society now bears all her expenses and provides medical and overall developmental assistance. Nandini has become an inseparable part of our lives, and our project \"Ray of Hope\" revolves around her. Join us in supporting more children like Nandini and spreading hope in their lives.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>'),
