(8536, 490, 'about_texts', '<p class=\"main-color\">Reg. No.: S0027580 of 2022-2023, Registered under WB Society Act.</p>\r\nRamdhanu is a society committed to providing equal rights, education, and opportunities to all children, especially those who are marginalised and living on the streets. Our vision is to empower these children through education, nutrition, healthcare, and cultural activities, so they can lead fulfilling lives and contribute positively to society. With the help of professional educators, we enroll street children in schools and support them with educational materials. We provide nutritious food to address their dietary needs, and conduct medical camps to address their health and hygiene issues. We also organize cultural events on notable days to encourage their active participation. Our goal is to create a space where all children have access to the resources they need to thrive.'),
