(11597, 756, 'section_2_title', 'Activities'),
(11598, 756, '_section_2_title', 'field_644be7c178ed3'),
(11599, 756, 'section_2_title_copy', 'Our \"Hopes & Hues\" project focuses on empowering children through the transformative power of art. We conduct regular workshops where children learn painting, sketching, crafts, and digital art under the guidance of professional artists and passionate volunteers. The children\'s artworks are showcased in exhibitions, raising awareness and funds to support the project. Additionally, collaborative public art projects bring color to community spaces, fostering teamwork and pride among the children. For those who have experienced trauma, we offer art therapy sessions led by trained therapists, providing a safe space for emotional expression and healing.'),
(11600, 756, '_section_2_title_copy', 'field_644be7d578ed4'),
