(14434, 929, 'about_title', 'Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society'),
(14435, 929, '_about_title', 'field_644bc06c879bc'),
(14436, 929, 'about_texts', '<p class=\"main-color\">Reg. No.: S0027580 of 2022-2023, Registered under WB Society Act.</p>\r\nWelcome to Ramdhanu\r\nPainting Dreams. Changing Lives.\r\n\r\nIn a world where millions are unseen and unheard, Ramdhanu is the burst of colour that refuses to fade. Born on the footpaths of Kolkata and reaching into the heart of forgotten villages, we stand by street children, tribal girls, and women who’ve been pushed to the margins.\r\n\r\nWe don’t just run projects—we build possibilities.\r\nWe don’t just teach—we empower.\r\nWe don’t just give—we walk together.\r\n\r\nFrom education to empowerment, skill-building to self-worth, we light up lives with dignity, love, and a splash of fearless hope.\r\n\r\nAt Ramdhanu, every colour tells a story. Come, be a part of our rainbow'),
(14437, 929, '_about_texts', 'field_644bc086879bd'),
(14438, 929, 'cause_title', 'Projects that don\'t just inspire hope — they ignite futures.'),
(14439, 929, '_cause_title', 'field_644bc3a4879bf'),
(14440, 929, 'cause_subtitle', 'Discover the causes that inspire and motivate us to create change. From empowering underprivileged children to protecting the environment, we are committed to driving progress in areas that matter. Explore our causes and join us in making a meaningful impact on the world.'),
(14441, 929, '_cause_subtitle', 'field_644bc3b4879c0'),
