(50, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bringing Joy and Education to Underprivileged Children</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The journey of the Colour of Hope project in Kolkata, led by the Mitrobinda Ghosh the founder, is a story of resilience, sacrifice, and unwavering hope. What began as a humble effort to teach three street children on the pavements has grown into a transformative mission, now nurturing 40 children in South Kolkata alone. The initial struggle was daunting—convincing parents, battling societal indifference, and navigating severe financial constraints. Many parents, entrenched in poverty, viewed education as a luxury they couldn’t afford, prioritizing immediate survival over long-term change. Mitrobinda had to fight against these mindsets, often standing alone, armed only with her vision and determination.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The financial challenges were equally overwhelming—intially there were no funds, no resources, and no guarantees. Yet, despite these hardships, she continued, driven by the belief that education could break the chains of poverty and give these children a future filled with dignity and opportunity. Today, Colour of Hope has become a sanctuary for 40 children in Kolkata, providing them with a day shelter home where they receive not only education but also love, care, and nutritious meals. This shelter symbolizes the triumph over every obstacle and serves as a beacon of hope, proving that even in the face of adversity, dreams can take flight.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Among the three street children who one has already achieved a remarkable milestone—passing the Madhyamik examination last year, a feat once unimaginable for a child living on the streets. The other two are preparing to appear for the Madhyamik this year, their eyes now filled with dreams of a brighter future with many more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Color Of Hope', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'color-of-hope', '', '', '2025-01-23 06:23:34', '2025-01-23 06:23:34', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=50', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(51, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '', 'Color Of Hope', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '50-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '2023-04-28 13:08:24', '', 50, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=51', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(52, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bringing Light to the Lives of Orphans and Visually Impaired Children</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">The \"Ray of Hope\" project by Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society is dedicated to helping blind children and orphans in underprivileged communities. We understand the challenges that blind children and orphans face and work to provide them with the resources they need to succeed in life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our team regularly visits blind homes and orphanages to provide food, clothes, and stationery to children in need. We aim to bring some joy and hope into their lives, and let them know that they are not alone. We also work to promote education and provide opportunities for blind children and orphans to learn and grow.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through the Ray of Hope project, we strive to create a brighter future for blind children and orphans. We believe that every child deserves the chance to live a happy and fulfilling life, regardless of their circumstances. With your support, we can continue to provide vital resources and support to these children and help them build a brighter future.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Ray Of Hope', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'ray-of-hope', '', '', '2023-06-01 14:34:58', '2023-06-01 14:34:58', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=52', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(53, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '', 'Ray Of Hope', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '52-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '2023-04-28 13:08:37', '', 52, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=53', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(54, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Empowering Women and Children in Remote Regions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">Welcome to our Beyond Boundaries project page! We are a non-profit organization dedicated to supporting underprivileged communities in various parts of India. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our current focus is on the Murgabani village in Birbhum district, which has a primarily tribal population and a large number of children under the age of 14 who do not have access to proper education and basic necessities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe that every child deserves the right to education, and we are working hard to make this a reality for the children of Murgabani. Our team visits the village once a month to distribute art kits, books, exercise books, and other school stationeries to the children. We also provide healthy, nutritious food to the children and their families during our visits. Our team speaks with the families and assesses the needs of the children to ensure that we can provide them with the necessary educational materials to help them excel in their studies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to our work in Murgabani, we have also provided support to communities in Ladakh and Varanasi. We distribute food and health kits, including sanitary napkins, to women and girls in these communities. We also provide education, books, and study materials to children who do not have access to these resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are a small organization with big dreams, and we are actively seeking generous funders to help us expand our projects and reach even more communities in need. Our ultimate goal is to ensure that all children, regardless of their social and economic backgrounds, have access to quality education and basic necessities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for your interest in our work, and please stay tuned for regular updates on our activities and progress towards our goal of promoting child rights and creating a better future for all children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Beyond Boundaries', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'beyond-boundaries', '', '', '2023-05-13 14:27:17', '2023-05-13 14:27:17', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=54', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(55, 1, '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '', 'Beyond Boundaries', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '54-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '2023-04-28 13:08:49', '', 54, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=55', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(56, 1, '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the Street, For the Street is a unique initiative by the (Tollygunge) Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society that aims to provide warmth and comfort to the homeless and underprivileged living on the streets of Kolkata. The campaign is organized every winter with the sole purpose of providing warm blankets to those who are struggling to survive the bitter cold weather.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As the temperature drops, the homeless and underprivileged are the ones who suffer the most. They are forced to endure the harsh cold weather with no protection or shelter. This is where our organization steps in. Our team of dedicated volunteers work tirelessly to identify areas in Kolkata where the homeless are living and distribute blankets to them. We try our best to reach out to as many people as possible and provide them with the warmth and comfort they deserve during the winter season.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Blanket Donation Campaign is not just about providing warm blankets, it\'s about bringing hope and comfort to those who need it the most. We understand the importance of ensuring that the homeless and underprivileged feel seen, heard and cared for. The campaign provides an opportunity for individuals to come together and make a difference in the lives of those in need. Through this initiative, we hope to create a community of people who are dedicated to making a positive impact in the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us in our mission to provide warmth and comfort to the homeless and underprivileged during the winter season. Your contribution can make a huge difference in someone\'s life. Together, let\'s bring a smile on the faces of those who are struggling to survive on the streets. Let\'s show them that they are not alone and that we are here to support them. Let\'s make Kolkata a better place for all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'On the Street, For The Street', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'on-the-street-for-the-street', '', '', '2023-06-01 14:23:17', '2023-06-01 14:23:17', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=56', 0, 'page', '', 0),
(57, 1, '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '', 'On the Street, For The Street', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '56-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '2023-04-28 13:09:01', '', 56, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=57', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
