(285, 1, '2023-05-04 05:53:11', '2023-05-04 05:53:11', '', 'On the Street, For The Street', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '56-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-04 05:53:11', '2023-05-04 05:53:11', '', 56, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=285', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(286, 1, '2023-05-04 06:06:22', '2023-05-04 06:06:22', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>On the Street, For the Street is a unique initiative by the (Tollygunj) Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society that aims to provide warmth and comfort to the homeless and underprivileged living on the streets of Kolkata. The campaign is organized every winter with the sole purpose of providing warm blankets to those who are struggling to survive the bitter cold weather.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As the temperature drops, the homeless and underprivileged are the ones who suffer the most. They are forced to endure the harsh cold weather with no protection or shelter. This is where our organization steps in. Our team of dedicated volunteers work tirelessly to identify areas in Kolkata where the homeless are living and distribute blankets to them. We try our best to reach out to as many people as possible and provide them with the warmth and comfort they deserve during the winter season.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Blanket Donation Campaign is not just about providing warm blankets, it\'s about bringing hope and comfort to those who need it the most. We understand the importance of ensuring that the homeless and underprivileged feel seen, heard and cared for. The campaign provides an opportunity for individuals to come together and make a difference in the lives of those in need. Through this initiative, we hope to create a community of people who are dedicated to making a positive impact in the world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join us in our mission to provide warmth and comfort to the homeless and underprivileged during the winter season. Your contribution can make a huge difference in someone\'s life. Together, let\'s bring a smile on the faces of those who are struggling to survive on the streets. Let\'s show them that they are not alone and that we are here to support them. Let\'s make Kolkata a better place for all.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'On the Street, For The Street', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '56-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-04 06:06:22', '2023-05-04 06:06:22', '', 56, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=286', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
