(302, 1, '2023-05-04 14:40:18', '2023-05-04 14:40:18', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Ramdhanu strongly believes in collaborations and hence collaborates with various organizations to reach out to more underprivileged children. The Rotaract Club is one such organization with which Ramdhanu frequently collaborates to organize events for children living on the streets, providing them with clothes, food, and educational stationery. Additionally, Ramdhanu also collaborated with Akshar School for their \"Each One Teach One\" project, where students of Akshar School came to teach and participate in various events for Ramdhanu\'s children. Akshar School teachers also regularly joined in to teach, take workshops, and distribute school stationary and food. Ramdhanu\'s children were even given the opportunity to showcase their talent in Heritage School\'s prestigious event, \"Youthopia by Heritage School\", where three of Ramdhanu\'s children performed in front of a thousand audiences for the first time.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Collaborations', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'collaborations', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:25', '2026-06-09 12:02:25', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=302', 0, 'event', '', 0),
