(315, 1, '2023-05-04 15:22:05', '2023-05-04 15:22:05', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Our cultural program events are a celebration of various festivals throughout the year. We bring smiles to as many children as we can by organizing various activities during festivals such as Durga Pujo, Christmas, Holi, and Poila Boishakh. We give them new clothes, bags, and stationery, take them to restaurants, organize sit and draw competitions, and offer food. For Holi, we hosted a storytelling event and concluded with playing Holi. For Poila Boishakh, we gave them traditional clothes and organize cultural activities such as dancing, singing, and poetry recitation. Our cultural events aim to nurture tradition and culture while bringing joy and happiness to the children.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Culture Programs', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'culture-programs', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:27', '2026-06-09 12:02:27', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=315', 0, 'event', '', 0),
