(343, 1, '2023-05-04 16:51:28', '2023-05-04 16:51:28', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\r\n<p>Ramdhanu organizes quarterly health checkups for street children, with the assistance of renowned practicing doctors. Our medical team comprises Dr. Nibedita Manna, an MD in Pediatrics. During the checkups, we primarily evaluate the kids\' nutrition levels, report any minor health concerns to the doctors, and take necessary actions such as buying them required medications, conducting further checkups, or admitting them to hospitals. Additionally, we provide the children with prescribed nutritional supplements like vitamin gummies and calcium tablets. Join us in ensuring the well-being of these precious children.</p>\r\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Medical Camp', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'medical-camp', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:35', '2026-06-09 12:02:35', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?page_id=343', 0, 'event', '', 0),
