(398, 1, '2023-05-06 05:19:37', '2023-05-06 05:19:37', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Supporting Marginalized Children\'s Education</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society is committed to helping children living in difficult circumstances, including orphans and visually impaired children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In the Southern Avenue area of Kolkata, the organization has identified a cluster of 28 children who are either living on the street or in a temporary shelter near Kalighat. With the help of volunteers, the organization has been providing educational, nutritional, and medical support to these children. They have also been arranging regular workshops, cultural events, and meetings with parents to encourage the children\'s progress and uplift their spirits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to their work in Kolkata, the Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society has also started a project in the Murgabani village of Birbhum district to support the children in tribal villages who are struggling with poverty and lack of education. While the organization is new and actively seeking funds to support their activities, they have already started supplying educational materials and arranging workshops on drawing, painting, and crafts for the children in the village. Their team is assessing more opportunities to support the children of this village and looking for generous funders who can help fulfill the children\'s needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As a small organization with big dreams, Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society is committed to ensuring that all children who have been marginalized by society have the right to livelihood and education. They have dared to pursue their dream and expand their projects to support more children in need. The organization will regularly update their supporters on their activities and work on child rights, and they invite others to join them in their efforts to make a difference in the lives of these children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Beyond Boundaries', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '54-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-06 05:19:37', '2023-05-06 05:19:37', '', 54, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=398', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(403, 1, '2023-05-06 05:33:52', '2023-05-06 05:33:52', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Empowering Women and Children in Remote Regions</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">Welcome to our Beyond Boundaries project page! We are a non-profit organization dedicated to supporting underprivileged communities in various parts of India. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our current focus is on the Murgabani village in Birbhum district, which has a primarily tribal population and a large number of children under the age of 14 who do not have access to proper education and basic necessities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We believe that every child deserves the right to education, and we are working hard to make this a reality for the children of Murgabani. Our team visits the village once a month to distribute art kits, books, exercise books, and other school stationeries to the children. We also provide healthy, nutritious food to the children and their families during our visits. Our team speaks with the families and assesses the needs of the children to ensure that we can provide them with the necessary educational materials to help them excel in their studies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In addition to our work in Murgabani, we have also provided support to communities in Ladakh and Varanasi. We distribute food and health kits, including sanitary napkins, to women and girls in these communities. We also provide education, books, and study materials to children who do not have access to these resources.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We are a small organization with big dreams, and we are actively seeking generous funders to help us expand our projects and reach even more communities in need. Our ultimate goal is to ensure that all children, regardless of their social and economic backgrounds, have access to quality education and basic necessities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for your interest in our work, and please stay tuned for regular updates on our activities and progress towards our goal of promoting child rights and creating a better future for all children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Beyond Boundaries', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '54-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-06 05:33:52', '2023-05-06 05:33:52', '', 54, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=403', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
