(509, 1, '2023-05-19 06:30:54', '2023-05-19 06:30:54', '', 'WhatsApp Image 2023-05-19 at 08.30.10', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'whatsapp-image-2023-05-19-at-08-30-10', '', '', '2023-05-19 06:30:54', '2023-05-19 06:30:54', '', 44, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/WhatsApp-Image-2023-05-19-at-08.30.10.jpeg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(510, 1, '2023-05-19 06:31:05', '2023-05-19 06:31:05', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ramdhanu - A Journey of Hope and Empowerment for Street Children</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">I am Mitrobinda Ghosh, the founder, secretary, and project director of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society. Let me tell you the story of how it all began.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was a rainy afternoon during the pandemic when I first met the street children. They had lost all hope and were struggling to arrange even two square meals a day. I gave them colours and papers and they created rainbows out of the darkness and pain. That\'s how Ramdhanu was born.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I had known them for years, but during the darkest phase of our lives, I felt the need to educate them. We started with just four children, sitting on a mat on the pavement and painting together. My then nine-year-old daughter always accompanied me, and we taught them basic mathematics and literature. They taught me to be patient and compassionate, and it was always a both-way learning situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When the pandemic was over, we put all of them in school, and by then, we had 24 street children and three volunteers who are still an essential part of our organization. We started taking care of all their needs, from school fees to health checkups, from nutrition to basic hygiene.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While educating and empowering these children is our most important project, we have also broadened our horizons. We started a project called \'Beyond Boundaries,\' where we visit remote places to educate destitute children and distribute food. We work with the tribal children of Murgaboni, Birbhum, on a regular basis, and there is another project called \'Ray of Hope\' where we work and take care of blind children. Whenever possible, we distribute food, clothes, and blankets to street people.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of this would have been possible without so many well-wishers who are always there to support us. We dare to dream big only because of their unconditional love.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I would like to thank my team members for their efforts, dedication, meticulous planning, and, especially, for approving all my weird ideas and thoughts. Our Ramdhanu is just a toddler now, and we have miles to go, but we firmly believe that if we can bring positive change in a single child\'s life, we will consider ourselves successful. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '44-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-19 06:31:05', '2023-05-19 06:31:05', '', 44, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=510', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(511, 1, '2023-05-19 06:32:42', '2023-05-19 06:32:42', '', 'mission', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'mission', '', '', '2023-05-19 06:32:42', '2023-05-19 06:32:42', '', 44, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/mission.webp', 0, 'attachment', 'image/webp', 0),
(512, 1, '2023-05-19 06:32:52', '2023-05-19 06:32:52', '<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ramdhanu - A Journey of Hope and Empowerment for Street Children</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"textColor\":\"luminous-vivid-orange\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-luminous-vivid-orange-color has-text-color\">I am Mitrobinda Ghosh, the founder, secretary, and project director of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society. Let me tell you the story of how it all began.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It was a rainy afternoon during the pandemic when I first met the street children. They had lost all hope and were struggling to arrange even two square meals a day. I gave them colours and papers and they created rainbows out of the darkness and pain. That\'s how Ramdhanu was born.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I had known them for years, but during the darkest phase of our lives, I felt the need to educate them. We started with just four children, sitting on a mat on the pavement and painting together. My then nine-year-old daughter always accompanied me, and we taught them basic mathematics and literature. They taught me to be patient and compassionate, and it was always a both-way learning situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When the pandemic was over, we put all of them in school, and by then, we had 24 street children and three volunteers who are still an essential part of our organization. We started taking care of all their needs, from school fees to health checkups, from nutrition to basic hygiene.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While educating and empowering these children is our most important project, we have also broadened our horizons. We started a project called \'Beyond Boundaries,\' where we visit remote places to educate destitute children and distribute food. We work with the tribal children of Murgaboni, Birbhum, on a regular basis, and there is another project called \'Ray of Hope\' where we work and take care of blind children. Whenever possible, we distribute food, clothes, and blankets to street people.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>None of this would have been possible without so many well-wishers who are always there to support us. We dare to dream big only because of their unconditional love.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I would like to thank my team members for their efforts, dedication, meticulous planning, and, especially, for approving all my weird ideas and thoughts. Our Ramdhanu is just a toddler now, and we have miles to go, but we firmly believe that if we can bring positive change in a single child\'s life, we will consider ourselves successful. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'About Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '44-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-19 06:32:52', '2023-05-19 06:32:52', '', 44, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=512', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(513, 1, '2023-05-19 07:17:22', '2023-05-19 07:17:22', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for considering supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society. Your contribution can make a significant difference in the lives of underprivileged children and help us continue our mission of bringing hope and empowerment to those in need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bank Details: Account Number: 41543326156 Account Name: Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society IFSC Code: SBIN0007026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Gateway: You can also make a donation through our secure online gateway by visiting the following link: <a href=\"https://www.instamojo.com/@hoperamdhanu\">https://www.instamojo.com/@hoperamdhanu</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tax Benefits: We would like to inform you that all donations made to Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society are 80G compliant and tax-free. Your support not only makes a positive impact on the lives of vulnerable children but also provides you with tax benefits as per applicable regulations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your Contribution Matters: Every donation, no matter the size, is valuable and greatly appreciated. Your support enables us to provide essential resources, education, healthcare, and a better future for the children we serve. With your generosity, we can continue our efforts to break the cycle of poverty and create lasting change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact Us: If you have any questions or require further information, please feel free to reach out to us. We are grateful for your interest in supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society, and we look forward to partnering with you in our mission to create a brighter future for underprivileged children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for your generosity and support!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Support Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '158-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-05-19 07:17:22', '2023-05-19 07:17:22', '', 158, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=513', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
