(856, 1, '2025-03-11 18:33:27', '2025-03-11 18:33:27', 'In November 2024, our regular art festival in Murgaboni, Birbhum, once again brought together 250 children and their families for a day of creativity and celebration. Each child received art kits and study stationery, while nearly 350 people were served meals in a joyous gathering that felt like a festival. The children also participated in an art workshop, making the event a vibrant blend of learning, fun, and community bonding.', 'Spreading Joy Through Art in Murgaboni', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'spreading-joy-through-art-in-murgaboni', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:42', '2026-06-09 12:02:42', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?post_type=event&#038;p=856', 0, 'event', '', 0),
