(862, 1, '2025-03-11 18:39:32', '2025-03-11 18:39:32', 'Continuing our annual tradition, the December Christmas Market was a heartwarming success. With a Children’s Corner, various stalls, and an array of stationery and handmade goodies created by our Ramdhanu children, the event saw an enthusiastic crowd. Activities like Secret Santa, gift-giving, and Christmas performances added to the festive spirit. As always, all proceeds went towards welfare initiatives, making this not just a celebration but a step towards a better future.', 'Christmas Market: A Celebration of Creativity & Giving', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'christmas-market-a-celebration-of-creativity-giving', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:05', '2026-06-09 12:02:05', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?post_type=event&#038;p=862', 0, 'event', '', 0),
