(867, 1, '2025-03-11 18:39:32', '2025-03-11 18:39:32', 'Continuing our annual tradition, the December Christmas Market was a heartwarming success. With a Children’s Corner, various stalls, and an array of stationery and handmade goodies created by our Ramdhanu children, the event saw an enthusiastic crowd. Activities like Secret Santa, gift-giving, and Christmas performances added to the festive spirit. As always, all proceeds went towards welfare initiatives, making this not just a celebration but a step towards a better future.', 'Christmas Market: A Celebration of Creativity & Giving', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '862-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-11 18:39:32', '2025-03-11 18:39:32', '', 862, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=867', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(869, 1, '2025-03-11 18:43:16', '2025-03-11 18:43:16', 'January 2025 brought a proud moment for us as Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society was honored as a special school at an award ceremony hosted by Dankuni Patha Bhavan School. Our children were invited to perform a dance recital, and their dedication shone through. They also had the opportunity to showcase and sell their handcrafted stationery items at a dedicated stall. The highlight of the event was the award presentation, where Biswanath Dasgupta, Director of TTIS (The Telegraph in Schools), along with the Headmaster of Dankuni Patha Bhavan School, handed over the award to our children, recognizing their talent and hard work.', 'Recognition & Celebration at Dankuni Patha Bhavan School', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'recognition-celebration-at-dankuni-patha-bhavan-school', '', '', '2026-06-09 12:02:36', '2026-06-09 12:02:36', '', 0, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?post_type=event&#038;p=869', 0, 'event', '', 0),
