(903, 1, '2025-05-05 06:31:02', '2025-05-05 06:31:02', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for considering supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society. Your contribution can make a significant difference in the lives of underprivileged children and help us continue our mission of bringing hope and empowerment to those in need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Enjoy Tax Benefits with Your Donation!</strong> We are proud to be a registered charity compliant with section 80G of the Income Tax Act. This means <strong>all donations made to Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society are tax-free</strong>, allowing you to make a positive impact while also benefiting from tax relief.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Donate us Via QR or NEFT/IMPS on Below Bank Account:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Bank Details:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Account Number:</strong> 41543326156 </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Account Name:</strong> Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>IFSC Code:</strong> SBIN0007026</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":735,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-medium\"><img src=\"http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/WhatsApp-Image-2024-06-22-at-6.50.23-PM-2-226x300.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-735\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Online Gateway: You can also make a donation through our secure online gateway by visiting the following link: <a href=\"https://daankosh.com/@hoperamdhanu\">https://daankosh.com/@hoperamdhanu</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tax Benefits: We would like to inform you that all donations made to Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society are 80G compliant and tax-free. Your support not only makes a positive impact on the lives of vulnerable children but also provides you with tax benefits as per applicable regulations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Your Contribution Matters: Every donation, no matter the size, is valuable and greatly appreciated. Your support enables us to provide essential resources, education, healthcare, and a better future for the children we serve. With your generosity, we can continue our efforts to break the cycle of poverty and create lasting change.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact Us: If you have any questions or require further information, please feel free to reach out to us. We are grateful for your interest in supporting Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society, and we look forward to partnering with you in our mission to create a brighter future for underprivileged children.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thank you for your generosity and support!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Support Us', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '158-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-05-05 06:31:02', '2025-05-05 06:31:02', '', 158, 'http://localhost/ramdhanu-website/?p=903', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(904, 1, '2025-05-05 14:08:44', '2025-05-05 14:08:44', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every girl who appeared for the Madhyamik exams under the guidance of Tollygunge Ramdhanu Social Welfare Society—from the bustling streets of Kolkata to the quiet strength of Murgaboni village—has passed with flying colors!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Priyanka and Sonia, who once dropped out of school, joined us just four years ago. Today, they stand as powerful symbols of resilience, determination, and change. And Lokkhimoni Hansda, a dedicated young woman from the tribal community who now leads our learning centre in Murgaboni, has also excelled.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Ramdhanu, women uplift women. It’s a space where everyday miracles unfold.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>To our well-wishers: your love and unwavering support make all of this possible. This achievement is ours—together.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Media Coverage:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bXZm7fvJ9d8\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bXZm7fvJ9d8\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We’ve been incredibly grateful for the attention this story has received. You can read more about it in these articles:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://www.eimuhurte.com/kolkata/priyanka-and-sonia-passed-madhyamik-examination-by-studying-on-the-footpath/#google_vignette\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Ei Muh